      "content": "[10] ops -> dev: Kindly update src/payments/handler.py to implement banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN). The test suite expects charge_amount(105, 1.5) == 158. Currently, the code truncates using int(). Instead, use Decimal with quantize and ROUND_HALF_EVEN. Example:\n\nfrom decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\ndef charge_amount(cents: int, fx_rate: float) -> int:\n    result = Decimal(cents) * Decimal(str(fx_rate))\n    return int(result.quantize(Decimal('1'), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN))"
    }
  }
